  "cells": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.96874256535949,
        107.05314835858587,
        246.54663651960783,
        15.090795454545514
      ],
      "text": "Goodwill and Intangible Assets ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Roman",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05915514705883,
        125.26386521464656,
        847.9286908496731,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "Goodwill is recognized as the excess cost of an acquired entity over the net amount assigned to assets acquired and liabilities assumed.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07370277777778,
        139.54894854797988,
        857.9341211601306,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "Goodwill is not amortized. Goodwill is reviewed for impairment annually as of January 1 or whenever changes in conditions indicate an ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.08837267156864,
        153.83403188131308,
        838.2138597630719,
        13.34263983585879
      ],
      "text": "evaluation should be completed. These conditions could include a significant change in the business climate, legal factors, operating ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.1029387254902,
        168.1191152146465,
        856.4628174019609,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "performance indicators, competition, or sale or disposition of a significant portion of a reporting unit. The Company utilizes discounted ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.06010812908497,
        182.41272727272724,
        857.3655593545752,
        13.342652777777857
      ],
      "text": "cash flow models and market multiples for comparable businesses to determine the fair value of reporting units. Evaluating impairment ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.06005620915033,
        196.69782354797985,
        853.4447183006537,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "requires significant judgment by management, including estimated future operating results, estimated future cash flows, the long-term ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.0746239379085,
        210.6726243686869,
        840.1086342320261,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "rate of growth of the business, and determination of an appropriate discount rate. While the Company uses available information to ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.0746239379085,
        224.95770770202023,
        491.04969101307194,
        13.342652777777857
      ],
      "text": "prepare the estimates and evaluations, actual results could differ significantly. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.0892419117647,
        243.28809848484855,
        805.1264762254901,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "The Company recognizes acquired intangible assets such as customer relationships, trade names, vendor relationships, and non-",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07273137254901,
        257.26922790404046,
        812.3721677287582,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "competition agreements apart from goodwill. Customer relationship intangibles are amortized using the sum-of-the-years-digits ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.08724718137256,
        271.5543112373738,
        823.5512716094772,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "method over estimated useful lives consistent with assumptions used in the determination of their value. Amortization of all other ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.10176299019608,
        285.8393945707071,
        812.0223546568626,
        13.342639835858677
      ],
      "text": "finite-lived intangible assets is computed using the straight-line method over the estimated period of benefit. The Company also ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.08709477124182,
        300.12447790404053,
        808.2478892973855,
        13.34263983585845
      ],
      "text": "maintains intangible assets with indefinite lives which are not amortized. Amortization of intangible assets is included in selling, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07293737745098,
        314.420303030303,
        852.5265377042484,
        13.342652777777857
      ],
      "text": "distribution and administrative expenses in the accompanying statements of consolidated income. Intangible assets with finite lives are ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.08755535130719,
        328.7053993055556,
        844.4228441584968,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "reviewed for impairment when changes in conditions indicate carrying value may not be recoverable. Intangible assets with indefinite ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.10207116013072,
        342.68020012626266,
        839.6956898692811,
        13.342639835858563
      ],
      "text": "lives are reviewed for impairment on an annual basis or whenever changes in conditions indicate an evaluation should be completed. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.96874256535949,
        362.0613323863637,
        191.65045024509806,
        15.090795454545514
      ],
      "text": "Self-Insurance Liabilities ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Roman",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05664456699347,
        380.2708585858586,
        808.0848288807189,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "The Company maintains business insurance programs with significant self-insured retention covering workers\u2019 compensation, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07150539215687,
        394.5559419191919,
        855.855769526144,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "business, automobile, general product liability and other claims. The Company accrues estimated losses including those incurred but ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.08642986111111,
        408.84102525252524,
        831.3902069852941,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "not reported using actuarial calculations, models and assumptions based on historical loss experience. The Company maintains a ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.10130408496732,
        423.12610858585856,
        835.6726285130719,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "self-insured health benefits plan, which provides medical benefits to U.S. based employees electing coverage under the plan. The ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.0706361519608,
        437.4203547979798,
        855.6028172794117,
        13.342730429292942
      ],
      "text": "Company estimates its reserve for all unpaid medical claims including those incurred but not reported based on historical experience, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07068807189543,
        451.3951297348485,
        453.9399512254902,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "adjusted as necessary based upon management\u2019s reasoned judgment. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.96874256535949,
        470.77278061868685,
        170.22595718954247,
        15.090795454545514
      ],
      "text": "Revenue Recognition ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Roman",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05915514705883,
        488.9835233585859,
        786.6908362745099,
        13.342730429292942
      ],
      "text": "Sales are recognized when the sales price is fixed, collectability is reasonably assured and the product\u2019s title and risk of loss is ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07365253267974,
        503.2686196338384,
        845.2227310457516,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "transferred to the customer. Typically, these conditions are met when the product is shipped to the customer. The Company charges ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05729607843136,
        517.5566278409092,
        806.046755392157,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "shipping and handling fees when products are shipped or delivered to a customer, and includes such amounts in net sales. The ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05739824346405,
        531.8417111742425,
        820.7236483251635,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "Company reports its sales net of actual sales returns and the amount of reserves established for anticipated sales returns based on ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07196597222223,
        546.1267945075758,
        851.9770238153595,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "historical rates. Sales tax collected from customers is excluded from net sales in the accompanying statements of consolidated income. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.96874256535949,
        565.1975666035353,
        228.8302484477124,
        15.090795454545514
      ],
      "text": "Shipping and Handling Costs ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Roman",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05664456699347,
        583.4077657828284,
        794.7294808415033,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "The Company records freight payments to third parties in cost of sales and internal delivery costs in selling, distribution and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07145514705883,
        597.6928491161616,
        842.4404623366014,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "administrative expenses in the accompanying statements of consolidated income. Internal delivery costs in selling, distribution and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.07135130718954,
        611.977932449495,
        826.7501107026144,
        13.342717487373761
      ],
      "text": "administrative expenses were approximately $15,500, $15,400 and $14,400 for the fiscal years ended June 30, 2012, 2011 and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.11592205882353,
        626.2630157828282,
        123.88838022875818,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "2010, respectively. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.96874256535949,
        645.3339043560607,
        108.82001601307189,
        15.090795454545457
      ],
      "text": "Income Taxes ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Roman",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05664456699347,
        663.8549684343435,
        834.8832361519609,
        13.342717487373704
      ],
      "text": "Income taxes are determined based upon income and expenses recorded for financial reporting purposes. Deferred income taxes ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.06941017156863,
        678.1400517676768,
        824.8463892565361,
        13.342730429292942
      ],
      "text": "are recorded for estimated future tax effects of differences between the bases of assets and liabilities for financial reporting and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.06946041666667,
        692.1148655303031,
        843.1397250408497,
        13.342704545454524
      ],
      "text": "income tax purposes, giving consideration to enacted tax laws. Uncertain tax positions meeting a more-likely-than-not recognition ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.0695123366013,
        706.3999488636364,
        823.891312009804,
        13.342704545454524
      ],
      "text": "threshold are recognized in accordance with the Income Taxes topic of the ASC. The Company recognizes accrued interest and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05177581699347,
        720.6916972853535,
        566.0789239379085,
        13.342691603535343
      ],
      "text": "penalties related to unrecognized income tax benefits in the provision for income taxes. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.96874256535949,
        739.7580303030303,
        216.75007075163398,
        15.090795454545514
      ],
      "text": "Share-Based Compensation ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Roman",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05982675653594,
        758.2791073232323,
        808.5787549428105,
        13.342691603535343
      ],
      "text": "Following approval by the Company's shareholders in October 2011, the 2011 Long-Term Performance Plan (the \"2011 Plan\") ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05974971405229,
        772.5641906565656,
        795.3272400735294,
        13.342704545454552
      ],
      "text": "replaced the 2007 Long-Term Performance Plan (the \"2007 Plan\"). Share-based compensation represents the cost related to",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05969779411765,
        786.8492739898991,
        798.7730673202616,
        13.342704545454524
      ],
      "text": "share-based awards granted to associates under either the 2011 Plan or the 2007 Plan. The Company measures share-based ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.05974971405229,
        800.8240618686868,
        826.709574632353,
        13.342704545454524
      ],
      "text": "compensation cost at grant date, based on the estimated fair value of the award and recognizes the cost over the requisite service",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/NIRNUF+Frutiger-Light",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        935.76333251634,
        988.4817879103535,
        14.108840277777631,
        13.546305523989897
      ],
